# Copy to `.env` (see `.gitignore` — do not commit real URLs if the repo is public).
#
# Production / `npm run build`: your hosted API (no trailing slash).
# Example (Render): https://your-service.onrender.com
#
# Leave unset for local `npm run dev` — Vite proxies API calls to port 3001.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
